{"t":"PEP","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"PepsiCo, Inc.","ko":"펩시코","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","employees":306000,"hq":"Purchase, NY, United States","website":"https://www.pepsico.com","summary_en":"PepsiCo, Inc. engages in the manufacture, marketing, distribution, and sale of various beverages and convenient foods worldwide. The company operates through six segments: PepsiCo Foods North America; PepsiCo Beverages North America; International Beverages Franchise; Europe, Middle East and Africa; Latin America Foods; and Asia Pacific Foods. It offers cereals, chips, dips, granola bars, oatmeal, pasta, rice, and syrups and mixes; refrigerated dips and spreads; beverage concentrates, fountain syrups, and finished goods; and ready-to-drink tea and coffee products. The company also provides SodaStream sparkling water makers and related products, as well as various dairy products under the Agusha, Chudo, and Domik v Derevne brands. It serves wholesale and other distributors, foodservice customers, grocery stores, drug stores, convenience stores, discount/dollar stores, mass merchandisers, membership stores, hard discounters, e-commerce retailers and authorized independent bottlers, and others through a network of direct-store-delivery, customer warehouse, and distributor networks, as well as directly to consumers through e-commerce platforms and retailers. PepsiCo, Inc. was founded in 1898 and is based in Purchase, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"PepsiCo, Inc.는 전 세계적으로 다양한 음료와 간편 식품의 제조, 마케팅, 유통 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 회사는 6개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다: PepsiCo Foods North America; PepsiCo 음료 북미; 국제 음료 프랜차이즈; 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카; 라틴 아메리카 식품; 및 아시아 태평양 식품. 시리얼, 칩, 딥, 그래놀라 바, 오트밀, 파스타, 쌀, 시럽 및 믹스를 제공합니다. 냉장 딥 앤 스프레드; 음료 농축액, 분수 시럽 및 완제품; 바로 마실 수 있는 차와 커피 제품도 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 Agusha, Chudo 및 Domik v Derevne 브랜드의 다양한 유제품뿐만 아니라 SodaStream 탄산수 제조기 및 관련 제품도 제공합니다. 이는 도매 및 기타 유통업체, 식품 서비스 고객, 식료품점, 약국, 편의점, 할인/달러 매장, 대량 판매점, 회원 매장, 할인 판매점, 전자 상거래 소매업체 및 공인 독립 병 제조 업체 등에 직접 매장 배송 네트워크, 고객 창고 및 유통업체 네트워크를 통해 서비스를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 전자 상거래 플랫폼 및 소매업체를 통해 소비자에게 직접 서비스를 제공합니다. PepsiCo, Inc.는 1898년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 구매에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":144.935,"mcap":197508874240.0,"pe":18.230818,"fpe":16.864948,"peg":1.3571,"ps":2.0104525,"pb":8.868322,"ev_ebitda":12.276,"div":4.15,"beta":0.321,"hi52":171.48,"lo52":123.47},"fin":{"rev":98241003520.0,"rev_g":0.056,"eps_g":0.174,"gross":0.54327,"op":0.16046,"net":0.11091,"roe":0.52187,"fcf":9044249600.0,"cash":11162999808.0,"debt":51881000960.0,"de":230.716,"eps":7.95,"feps":8.59386},"own":{"short":0.0252,"inst":0.80052,"insider":0.00202},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":141.13635,"median":140.5,"high":165.0,"low":106.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.76,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":17,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":4,"hold":17,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":18,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":3,"hold":16,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":126.0,"priorPriceTarget":133.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":135.0,"priorPriceTarget":142.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":137.0,"priorPriceTarget":138.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":157.0,"priorPriceTarget":161.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarge